    "title": "Pride festival returns Sunday in Bloomington - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mike Hanks ,\n17 hours ago The 2026 Bloomington Pride MN Festival is this weekend.\nThe festival is 1-6 pm. Sunday, June 14, on the lawn of Bloomington Civic Plaza, 1800 W. Old Shakopee Road.\nThe annual festival features live performances, food trucks, family-friendly activities and approximately 100 vendors representing LGBTQ+ artists, makers, nonprofits and small businesses.\nEntertainment during the festival includes drag, live music, spoken word and local talent. Activities include crafts, story time and games for all ages.\nThe festival is organized by Bloomington Pride MN, a nonprofit organization.\nInfo: bloomingtonpridemn.org",
